Description: Drive the ageing and periodic task tests with a manual clock
 The tests slept on the real clock and counted what ran meanwhile, which
 loaded builders miss: AgeingTest.OneNotification on OBS Debian 12 aarch64,
 PeriodicExtern.MultipleTasks on Debian 13 aarch64. Ageing, packet timestamps
 and periodic tasks now take time from a replaceable process clock, which the
 tests advance by hand.
Author: Bryan Richter <b@chreekat.net>
Forwarded: https://github.com/p4lang/behavioral-model/pull/1477
